# AI agent modes and the harness > The envelope of an update run > After the run — red
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L202
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

test::a Run the tests ::e
  --> reject::a Reject the run ::e
  --> reset::a Reset to the baseline ::e
  --> free::a Release the write lock ::e

# This diagram tells one attempt — the one that fails. (Reject and reset happen
# in no other diagram; this is where they are declared.)
test, reject, reset, free --::P--> whole::a Attempt an update ::e

hn::a agent harness --> test, reject, reset, free
tests::a repo tests --> test
findings::a failing suite --> test, reject
mainwt::a main worktree --> test, reset
c0::a baseline commit --> reset
wl::a repo write lock --> free

test --> tests per run ::c
reject --> commit after ::c

hn --> harness ::c
tests --> test suite ::c
findings --> diagnostic ::c
mainwt --> ipm knowledge base ::c
c0 --> commit ::c
wl --> write lock ::c
